jvmcontract: com.fasterxml.jackson.core.io.doubleparser.FastDoubleSwar is a class of a multi-release JAR (prepare/old/lib/com.fasterxml.jackson.core/jackson-core-2.16.0.jar) that holds a class file of it for Java 11, 17, 19 (META-INF/versions/), which a JVM of that release or later loads in place of the base class file; the tool reads only the base, so the class is refused (lib/src/classpath.rs)
